│  • If the agent or multi-agent state is not found (None), a new    │
│    agent/multi-agent instance is created in the repository.        │
│  • Agents' messages and internal states are restored for existing  │
│    sessions; for new sessions messages are created anew.           │
│  • There is also logic to fix broken session histories.            │
